  "notes": "DRAW QBin(MUL, QConst(1), QCount(creatures you control with a +1/+1 counter)) (MAPPER_GUIDE 'N for each X'; Pridemalkin's selector), then INDESTRUCTIBLE until end of turn over the same ALL selector. The probe board has no counters. Packs: tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/inspiring_call_*.json."
